Wine 11.18 source tarball (https://dl.winehq.org/wine/source/11.x/wine-11.18.tar.xz, SHA-256
c6282f6d4daecf11f3ab9f9a2b6c598f67be7e28c363ba2cae8a3c44b611e7a4, LGPL-2.1+) with
tools/wine-patches/wow64cpu-rosetta.patch (LGPL-2.1+), by scripts/build-wow64cpu.sh. The patch follows the approach
of CodeWeavers' CrossOver (CW HACK 20760, also LGPL). Wine's license is in
Sources/GPlayerCore/Resources/licenses/Wine-COPYING.LIB.txt. That tarball, the patch and the build script are the
complete corresponding source for the file.

